<title>USA: Cheltenham School Dist, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Cheltenham School Dist, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public Financial Management, Inc, financial advisor to the Cheltenham Township School District, Pa., said it recalculated Boenning &amp; Scattergood, Inc's winning true interest cost for the District's $7.015 million bond issue.  Boenning's TIC is 4.7531 percent, reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 4.7241 percent originally calculated. Final details follow:</p>
